  "description": "The Anovo Surgical System (formerly Hominis) is a robotic-assisted surgical platform developed by Momentis Surgical for transvaginal and minimally invasive gynecological and pelvic surgery. The system features two miniaturized, humanoid-shaped articulating robotic arms with shoulder, elbow, and wrist joints providing multi-planar flexibility, delivered through a natural orifice (transvaginal) or abdominal ports under laparoscopic camera visualization. The surgeon operates from an ergonomic console with hand controllers. Anovo is authorized by the US FDA via De Novo and 510(k) clearances for benign transvaginal hysterectomy, salpingo-oophorectomy, and general surgical procedures.",
